.Here is a tailored `.gitignore` specifically configured for this Python socket and media streaming application:

```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / optimized Python files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# App-specific runtime downloads (created by os.path.expanduser('~')/ChatDownloads)
ChatDownloads/
downloads/
received_files/

# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE & Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Temporary test media & logs
*.log
*.tmp
temp_recordings/
capture_test.*
test_files/

# Network / Wireshark packet captures
*.pcap
*.pcapng